    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What the data says",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "color": "#F0455A"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Margin rose 2.0 pts (7.2% to 9.2%, FY22 to FY25). Fuel fell from 22.7% to 15.5% of revenue (+7.2 pts); labor (-4.1 pts) and other costs (-1.1 pts) gave most of it back.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#E8EDF5"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#E8EDF5"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Unit economics got worse, not better. Adjusted TRASM was flat (19.55 to 19.56 cents) while CASM-Ex rose from 12.87 to 13.86 cents, so the unit margin gap fell from 6.68 to 5.70 cents.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#E8EDF5"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#E8EDF5"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. The lasting gain is the balance sheet. Total debt fell from $26.9B to $14.1B, Debt/EBITDA from 6.9x to 1.7x, and interest coverage reached 8.6x in FY2025.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#E8EDF5"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#E8EDF5"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
